// Bake recipe of the `fx_ground` set (plan docs/plans/2026-11-09-effect-visualization.md §6.3,
// WP6a): `asset_baker effect-bake --recipe <this file> --sources-dir <dir holding the sources>
// --ledger docs/evidence/veo/ledger.jsonl --output-dir assets/effects`.
//
// Sources are named by their bare file names; each is cited by its ledger line in
// assets/effects/fx_ground.provenance.ron. Review: docs/evidence/effects/review/texture_review.md.
// - chitin_spine (review round 2, WP6c; replaces the Veo `spine_erupt` flipbook, whose regular
//   row of pale wedges read as a comb): four generated black/white pairs, each one curved
//   chitin spine side-on (claw, scythe hook, barbed thorn, S-curve). Their difference mattes
//   failed the residual rule (1.4 to 2.4 % of pixels above 4/255: the on-white edits redraw the
//   edges and add a floor shadow), so the pictures on black ship with the silhouette key
//   (`Solid`), which keeps the dark umber body opaque; variants. The effect raises and sinks
//   them.
// - spine_crack (review round 2): three generated stills, top-down, a small burst of cracks
//   where a spine punches up; variants.
// - ground_crack: two generated stills, top-down, a crack tapering to hairlines at both ends,
//   so segments chain along a line with overlap; variants, one layer each.
(
    set: "fx_ground",
    cell_size: 256,
    elements: [
        (
            name: "chitin_spine",
            look: Solid,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_ground.chitin_spine.20261110T090833Z-1077968-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.chitin_spine.20261110T090916Z-1080994-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.chitin_spine.20261110T090944Z-1082596-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.chitin_spine.20261110T091245Z-1096361-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
        (
            name: "spine_crack",
            look: Lit,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_ground.spine_crack.20261110T091941Z-1161892-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.spine_crack.20261110T092043Z-1166097-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.spine_crack.20261110T092204Z-1171787-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
        (
            name: "ground_crack",
            look: Lit,
            source: Variants(pictures: [
                Still(file: "fx_ground.ground_crack.20261110T004422Z-2247765-1.on_black.png"),
                Still(file: "fx_ground.ground_crack.20261110T004525Z-2253706-1.on_black.png"),
            ]),
        ),
    ],
)
